### Critical architectural rule

Keep these three layers separate:

```text
UrielSnips
     ↓
Snippet/content library

Uriel Language
     ↓
Syntax + parser + AST + LSP

Uriel Studio
     ↓
VS Code application + UI + commands + project management
```

That separation prevents the project from turning into one enormous `extension.ts` file and gives **Uriel Studio** room to grow into the full authoring platform originally envisioned.
